1
00:00:00,814 --> 00:00:02,944
(Howard:)Hey, guys,
guess who's back from space.

2
00:00:03,150 --> 00:00:05,210
(All:)Not now!

3
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:14,390
Oh, ow! Blueberry in my nose!
Blueberry in my nose!

4
00:00:14,761 --> 00:00:16,961
(Leonard:)Snort it down and keep eating!

5
00:00:28,608 --> 00:00:30,338
(Waitress:)You look familiar.

6
00:00:30,744 --> 00:00:32,114
(Penny:)I don't think so.

7
00:00:32,546 --> 00:00:33,706
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

8
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:35,280
(Waitress:)I just saw you on the news.

9
00:00:36,216 --> 00:00:37,476
(Waitress:)You're an astronaut.

10
00:00:37,684 --> 00:00:39,884
(Dr Schneider:)Yes. Yes, I am.

11
00:00:40,086 --> 00:00:44,486
(Waitress:)Good for you. How about a piece
of cheesecake on the house?

12
00:00:44,691 --> 00:00:47,591
(Howard:)Oh, thank you so much.
I've been having the worst night.

13
00:00:47,761 --> 00:00:51,091
(Howard:)I just got back and my friends don't care,
my wife's sick.

14
00:00:51,298 --> 00:00:53,788
- Went to my mom's...
- You want the cheesecake or not?

15
00:00:56,303 --> 00:00:57,363
(Howard:)Yes, please.

16
00:01:01,441 --> 00:01:04,571
And I think it's gonna be a long, long time

17
00:01:04,744 --> 00:01:07,974
Till touchdown brings me round again to find

18
00:01:08,148 --> 00:01:12,308
(Howard:)I'm not the man they think I am at home
Oh, no, oh, no

19
00:01:12,519 --> 00:01:14,919
(Howard:)I'm a rocket man

20
00:01:21,394 --> 00:01:23,044
(Howard:)Perfect.

